          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Multiple rough spots for months; mostly asymptomatic until the last few weeks, with intermittent itch and irritation, especially with gloves or a hat. No pain, bleeding, or ulceration. No B symptoms reported."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
